[[0,1397783,0,2,2,0,"2016-11-08T16:06:54","eagleshigh","",[],"<p>There was a new special on the history channel last night. He talked about vote rigging in the city. Some quatrains predict a &quot;blonde masculine woman&quot; and the man with the &quot;forked tongue&quot;. </p>\n<p>Sheeeeit. Keep an eye out for this special. It was pretty up to date and talked about the second debate between Drumpfstein and Clintonwitz.</p>","Nostradmus predicted the election.","","whatever"],[1,6759952,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:23:20","eagleshigh","[e]",[],"<p>I took a picture of one of the quatrains. It said &quot;when the great Queen sees herself conquered, she will show an excess of masculine courage.&quot; </p>\n<p><a href=\"http://m.imgur.com/KSWmwHF\">http://m.imgur.com/KSWmwHF</a></p>\n<p>Some people interpret this as Drumpfstein winning. </p>\n<p>Don't mind my big box TV. Still living in the past. Don't like the new TVs. </p>"],[2,6760007,6759952,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:31:43","antiracist3","",[],"<p>The History channel is your level of rigor.</p>"],[3,6760015,6760007,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:32:33","eagleshigh","",[],"<p>I know right? Don't lay down at night and relax watching television, that's your level of rigor. What do you watch on television? </p>"],[4,6760022,6760015,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:33:05","antiracist3","",[],"<p>Family Guy.</p>"],[5,6760028,6760022,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:34:02","eagleshigh","",[],"<p>What's your favorite episode? </p>"],[6,6760042,6760028,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:35:14","antiracist3","",[],"<p>The ones where they make fun of italians, blacks, and jews.</p>"],[7,6760047,6760042,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:36:47","eagleshigh","",[],"<p>That's a good one. I'm more of an American Dad fan. </p>"],[8,6760059,6760047,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:38:46","Antiracist4","",[],"<p>Did you drop logic?</p>"],[9,6760086,6760059,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:42:21","eagleshigh","",[],"<p>No</p>"],[1,6760451,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T17:33:10","BigFatDaddy","",[],"<p>I thought Hillary was the Whore of Babylon?</p>"]]
