[[0,1397787,0,5,0,5,"2016-11-08T16:07:56","FritzDrebbin","",[],"","Prince Harry admits he's dating a non-white, says critics are racist","http://www.dailymail.co.uk/news/article-3916188/It-s-official-Prince-Harry-dating-Suits-actress-Meghan-Markle.html","European"],[1,6760090,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T16:42:35","fluxusp","",[],"<p>How is having your own <strong>preference</strong> racist?!</p>"],[1,6760173,0,3,0,3,"2016-11-08T16:53:10","Dumb_Comment_Bot","",[],"<p>He reminds me of one of those disappointing sons/nephews you have in medieval strategy games. The ones you send off to fight in the crusades as teenagers to toughen them up and then you get a ransom demand for them which you unashamedly decline.</p>"],[1,6760342,0,1,0,1,"2016-11-08T17:15:49","lorlipone","",[],"<p>It's too bad he isn't a majestically unfuckable 4channer. The eventual &quot;You're a Wizard, Harry!&quot; joke would be priceless. </p>"],[1,6761108,0,0,0,0,"2016-11-08T19:02:06","fritz_maurentod","",[],"<p>Doing what royal families have been doing for centuries: marry foreigners to appease people. </p>"]]
